If you want to use that formula shouldn't everyone get a 1660 super? Or better still CPU onboard graphics 100fps in CSGO for 0% £.

You think someone short on money would say the RTX 3080 FE is at a great price point? You have to remember the value of money is relative to how much you have. I have the extra cash to spend so why would i go for the lower end cards just saying :) the money i spent was not needed for food, bills or anything important i am not in debt so why not get the best

